        "name": "",
        "username": "Thunderbird",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2022-12-02T03:33:17.939Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don’t get too excited yet. It’s not Badell &amp; Rebottaro, just Coppola.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt10128846/\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/312c358beba5850687420a4883dfe06201bcc21b.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt10128846/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IMDb</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5509d51746c13a202f8c065edf8119ed347be7ab_2_500x500.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5509d51746c13a202f8c065edf8119ed347be7ab_2_500x500.png, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5509d51746c13a202f8c065edf8119ed347be7ab_2_750x750.png 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5509d51746c13a202f8c065edf8119ed347be7ab_2_1000x1000.png 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/5/5509d51746c13a202f8c065edf8119ed347be7ab_2_10x10.png\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt10128846/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Megalopolis - IMDb</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Megalopolis: Directed by Francis Ford Coppola. With Aubrey Plaza, Adam Driver, James Remar, Shia LaBeouf. An architect wants to rebuild New York City as a utopia following a devastating disaster.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><em>An architect wants to rebuild New York City as a utopia following a devastating disaster.</em></p>\n<p>Will that be easier or harder when your universe isn’t in a Sandwich Bag™?</p>\n<p>Apparently this has been in Development Heck for some time and is finally filming. Don’t know if I’m super excited for it, but the name caught my eye. Looks like there have been other projects that incorporate “Megalopolis”, but this seems like the biggest name backing.</p>",
