        "raw": "Don't get too excited yet. It's not Badell & Rebottaro, just Coppola.\n\nhttps://www.imdb.com/title/tt10128846/\n\n*An architect wants to rebuild New York City as a utopia following a devastating disaster.*\n\nWill that be easier or harder when your universe isn't in a Sandwich Bag™?\n\nApparently this has been in Development Heck for some time and is finally filming. Don't know if I'm super excited for it, but the name caught my eye. Looks like there have been other projects that incorporate \"Megalopolis\", but this seems like the biggest name backing.",
